        {
          "t": "Rabbits are covered with *soft fur*. They have *long ears* and *short tails*.",
          "cn": "兔子身上有柔软的毛。它们有长耳朵和短尾巴。",
          "audio": "audio/sentences/k2-passage-rabbits/a-rabbits-are-covered-with-soft-fur-th-46732c.mp3"
